  "releaseNotes": "## [4.8.1.0] - 2025-02-26\n\n### Changed\n\n- Made `Teardown`, in EasyCallControl modules, awaitable. It will ensure that all call locks are released before completing the teardown. This will help in some cases, where applications fail to take call lock after multiple calls.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- An issue where the SDK could not retrieve device model parameters from the device. This issue affected PRO devices.\n- Updated the Device Connector for Windows to address an issue that could cause the Device Connector to crash.",
